acceptance_criteria: Typed parent clearing preserves forward and shared create-plan ambient-scope isolation; focused and full coverage gates pass without weaker assertions; record remaining upstream defects.
comments[6]{created_at,author,text}:
  "2026-11-04T18:56:36.674Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Production: pm-cli 2026.10.30 GH-1614 keeps typed sentinel values literal; forward create and shared atomic create-plan emitted parent:none and are refused on 2026.11.4. Replace with unset:[parent,goal,objective,sprint,release]. Test: fixture and reference-model parent:none controls have the same old-contract dependency; migrate explicit clears without removing assertions. npm registry confirms CLI/ops 2026.11.4 and changelog 2026.10.31."
  "2026-11-04T18:57:26.958Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"New test/typed-parent-clear.test.ts passes 2/2 on 2026.11.4; reverting only index.ts to the PR source fails both tests, then restoring the fix passes. It exercises forward creation and the shared create-plan options via real SDK persistence under ambient parent/scope focus. Before migration: forward-import 0/6, ownership 3/29, literal-values 0/6. Retain the conservative provider-value guard for the older declared minimum; update its stale documentation instead of broadening scope."
  "2026-11-04T18:59:30.455Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Secondary CLI pin: update test/estimate-packed-acceptance.ts default host from 2026.10.28 to 2026.11.4. Historical validation artifacts retain their measured versions; manifest/peer minimum remains >=2026.10.24. No tracked dist files or lint script. Typecheck, build:test, docstring, production audit (0 vulnerabilities), pack dry-run, release-date and publish-attestation checks pass. Strict tracked health exits 0 with an inherited provenance advisory; no history repair attempted."
  "2026-11-04T19:40:25.097Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"The packed estimate acceptance default now derives its host version from package.json rather than duplicating a calendar version; the existing explicit host-version override remains available. On this PR it resolves 2026.11.4, so future dependency bumps do not silently retain an older default."
  "2026-11-04T20:09:36.150Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Local budget reached after approximately 75 minutes. Stopped nice -n 10 env NPM_CONFIG_USERCONFIG=/dev/null npm run coverage while the 500-sequence forward failure/retry model was still active. Completed tests had no assertion failures, including the real 10002-item complete-corpus case, 500 dependency-graph sequences and 500 import/export/sync sequences. Cancellation reports for unfinished files are budget-stop effects, not SDK regressions. Full-suite pass counts and aggregate coverage are unmeasured; CI must finish the unchanged 99/96/100 gate and Node22/26/npm/Bun release acceptance. The targeted new regression passed 2/2 and failed both cases when only the production fix was reverted. No new upstream defect established."
  "2026-11-04T20:10:18.935Z",codex-toolchain-1104,"Interrupted-run summary: 166 passed, 0 failed, 20 cancelled. These are partial Node runner counts, including cancelled file placeholders, not a complete test inventory or a coverage pass."
